00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,280
Once the training is over,

293
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:11,880
I'll go back to being an instructor.

294
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,320
Nice and relaxing.

295
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,200
I won't worry about this anymore.

296
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,160
Drop the act.

297
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:18,120
As soon as the arena match ended,

298
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,920
I sent out a whole team

299
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,320
to gather information on you everywhere.

300
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:22,560
Holding such a grudge?

301
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:24,160
A soldier who doesn't hold grudges

302
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:24,920
is just a sucker.

303
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,320
I, Guo Zijian, am a blank slate,

304
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:30,240
I can't withstand such scrutiny, brother.

305
00:14:30,240 --> 00:14:32,160
You call yourself a blank slate?

306
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:33,280
Captain Guo.

307
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:34,960
After I went back

308
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:37,400
and looked at your background and experience,

309
00:14:38,640 --> 00:14:39,520
to be honest,

310
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,000
I was quite astounded.

311
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:44,120
If the two of us are fated,

312
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,080
it would definitely be on the battlefield

313
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:47,880
as the closest life-and-death partners.

314
00:14:49,760 --> 00:14:51,760
Peace is the highest reward for a soldier.

315
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,760
None of us want war.

316
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,880
Since we can't be life-and-death partners,

317
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:58,040
let's be rivals on the training ground,

318
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,000
and sharpen each other.

319
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:01,480
All right.

320
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:02,880
I'll definitely

321
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,760
strike harder each time.

322
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,960
We'll see about that.

323
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:12,680
The show's over.

324
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:13,440
Deputy Director Deng.

325
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:14,400
We should head out too.

326
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:17,000
I didn't expect that

327
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:17,880
after knowing each other for just two days,

328
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:19,640
they'd become fast friends.

329
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,720
You don't know someone until you fight them.

330
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,240
Heroes recognize heroes.

331
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:24,160
Don't you think

332
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:26,040
Wu Dazhou was hinting at something earlier?

333
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:29,280
Do you think he called us here

334
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,640
just to save face,

335
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:33,640
and have a simple debrief?

336
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:34,520
Isn't that the case?

337
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,640
I don't think this is

338
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,920
just a conversation between him and us.

339
00:15:39,760 --> 00:15:41,320
Someone else is behind him.

340
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:43,640
You mean

341
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,840
their coming to challenge us this time

342
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,280
wasn't just a typical showdown?

343
00:15:47,280 --> 00:15:47,760
Right.

344
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:49,960
I'm afraid this is

345
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,960
a test by the higher-ups on the army group's

346
00:15:52,800 --> 00:15:55,160
development of new-type combat forces.

347
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:57,840
In that case,

348
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:59,880
we must have passed the test, right?

349
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:02,440
I'm afraid it's not that simple.

350
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:06,720
Regardless,

351
00:16:06,920 --> 00:16:08,320
you should thank Wu Dazhou.

352
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:10,520
Yes, I really should thank him.

353
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:12,800
I wanted to challenge the champion before,

354
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:13,760
but I also said

355
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,160
it probably wouldn't go so smoothly.

356
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,320
But Wu Dazhou actually

357
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,520
solved this problem for me.

358
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,440
Congratulations.

359
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:21,240
After this challenge is over,

360
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:23,120
looks like you'll be reinstated right away.

361
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:26,440
If I get reinstated,

362
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:28,720
would you be willing to be my chief staff officer?

363
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:32,960
I'm afraid I can't.

364
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:35,080
After the training ends,

365
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:36,320
I'll be going to the research institute in Beijing

366
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:36,920
to report for duty.

367
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:39,640
Listen, Wu Dazhou,

368
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:42,000
