371
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:47,160
I didn't say anything, sir.

372
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,720
You didn't say anything directly,

373
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,040
but everything you said

374
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,640
was clearly tipping off Guo Zijian.

375
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,880
That really wasn't my intention.

376
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,840
You're overthinking it.

377
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:57,840
Go back and write a self-criticism.

378
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,320
Reflect thoroughly on this failure.

379
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:00,200
Yes, sir.

380
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:02,680
Deputy Director Deng,

381
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:05,400
actually, this time,

382
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:07,400
we didn't completely fail.

383
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:09,080
At the very least,

384
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:10,480
we helped Commander Jiang

385
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,240
