386
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,320
You're going to Beijing.

387
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,680
I was only here on secondment anyway.

388
00:17:29,800 --> 00:17:30,360
Going to Beijing

389
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,640
was the plan from the very beginning.

390
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:36,120
Beijing.

391
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:38,600
That's nice.

392
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:40,800
It's just a bit of a shame.

393
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:43,560
A shame about what?

394
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,240
It's just that what you're doing now,

395
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:46,440
this research project,

396
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:48,840
should really be embedded with frontline troops,

397
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:51,120
to participate more in actual combat.

398
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:52,680
Like this training session,

399
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:53,880
once you go to Beijing,

400
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:56,640
you might not get opportunities like this.

401
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:00,360
But going to Beijing has its perks.

402
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:01,640
Once I'm in Beijing,

403
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,760
I can get access to

404
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:03,880
the most cutting-edge theories

405
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,280
and military tech advancements.

406
00:18:06,600 --> 00:18:08,080
That may be true,

407
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:11,120
but practice is the sole criterion for testing truth.

408
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:12,320
True.

409
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,320
Practice tests theory,

410
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:16,320
but theory also guides practice.

411
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:18,000
They complement each other.

412
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,240
Neither is more important than the other.

413
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:21,920
After I leave for Beijing,

414
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:23,600
if you have any questions,

415
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:24,640
you can always ask me.

416
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,120
If I can't solve it,

417
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:27,120
I still have my mentors

418
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:28,000
and professors.

419
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:29,200
After all,

420
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:30,360
the academic atmosphere in Beijing

421
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:31,240
and its resources

422
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:32,320
are a bit better.

423
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:38,960
Commander,

424
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:40,000
To be honest,

425
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:42,120
being in our own camp

426
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:43,040
makes me feel at ease.

427
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:44,360
Yeah.

428
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,920
I came back to handle some paperwork,

429
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:48,360
and I feel exactly the same way.

430
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:50,800
As for the training team,

431
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:52,400
is there any news?

432
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:56,560
In his report, Deputy Director Deng,

433
00:18:57,360 --> 00:18:58,520
despite his objections to

434
00:18:59,120 --> 00:19:00,480
the New Quality Combined Force

435
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:01,440
being formed,

436
00:19:02,280 --> 00:19:03,040
has nevertheless

437
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:07,000
undoubtedly boosted Guo Zijian and the training team's

438
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:09,440
influence and visibility.

439
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:11,240
How is it?

440
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,160
Feeling a bit jealous, aren't you?

441
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:14,880
Commander,

442
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:17,200
