443
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:18,440
I'm not that broad-minded.

444
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,480
But for pushing Guo Zijian forward,

445
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:21,960
I don't regret it.

446
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:24,200
Actually, he was already

447
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:25,360
prepared for battle.

448
00:19:25,800 --> 00:19:27,600
Even if I didn't light this fuse,

449
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:29,880
he'd find a way to make it go off himself.

450
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,160
According to what you're saying,

451
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,680
Guo Zijian's victory

452
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:36,000
is greatly discounted.

453
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:38,960
First, in front of Wu Dazhou,

454
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:40,840
he pretended to be a docile

455
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,600
Support Team captain.

456
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:44,360
Then he used you

457
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:45,680
to provoke his anger.

458
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:48,040
Wu Dazhou, that fool,

459
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:50,280
underestimated the enemy

460
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:51,760
and acted on impulse.

461
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:53,240
No wonder he lost.

462
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:55,280
Whether he underestimated the enemy

463
00:19:55,280 --> 00:19:56,360
or acted on impulse,

464
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,520
Wu Dazhou deserved to lose this battle.

465
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:00,720
Guo Zijian

466
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:02,640
was prepared for battle long ago.

467
00:20:03,320 --> 00:20:04,480
Actually, this battle

468
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:06,920
