469
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:07,960
How so?

470
00:20:08,960 --> 00:20:10,200
Guo Zijian had long planned

471
00:20:10,200 --> 00:20:11,160
to challenge the titleholder.

472
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:13,000
But unexpectedly,

473
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:14,600
Wu Dazhou

474
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:17,040
stole my role.

475
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:19,200
It seems

476
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:22,640
Guo Zijian has a lot of confidence in you.

477
00:20:22,840 --> 00:20:23,560
He knew

478
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:25,560
you could definitely win this title.

479
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:27,720
Sometimes,

480
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:29,440
