481
00:20:29,600 --> 00:20:30,680
isn't necessarily your comrade,

482
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:34,000
but more often your opponent.

483
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:38,320
This Guo Zijian...

484
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:40,760
I really thought

485
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:41,960
he was content

486
00:20:41,960 --> 00:20:43,320
