487
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:44,800
I didn't expect him

488
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:46,200
to put up a front

489
00:20:46,280 --> 00:20:47,600
while secretly making his move.

490
00:20:48,720 --> 00:20:49,560
It's understandable.

491
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:52,600
His battalion commander was dismissed,

492
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:54,880
