493
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,720
If he didn't endure hardship to bounce back,

494
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,360
he wouldn't be a real man.

495
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,440
It seems this setback

496
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,360
really taught him a lesson.

497
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:05,840
Quietly,

498
00:21:06,200 --> 00:21:07,680
he did everything he needed to do.

499
00:21:08,120 --> 00:21:08,880
On this point alone,

500
00:21:09,560 --> 00:21:10,520
I admit I fall short.

501
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:13,040
You shouldn't be too modest.

502
00:21:14,320 --> 00:21:15,600
Since the group army

503
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:17,040
