506
00:21:20,520 --> 00:21:21,240
Besides,

507
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:23,440
I'm still the deputy captain of the training team.

508
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:25,120
When it's time to speak up,

509
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:26,800
I won't hold back.

510
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:27,960
Understood.

511
00:22:27,520 --> 00:22:28,240
Staff Officer Liang.

512
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:31,960
Can you come down for a minute?

513
00:22:32,960 --> 00:22:34,240
Yes, I'm right downstairs.

514
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:36,440
Okay.

515
00:22:54,120 --> 00:22:55,440
Captain Guo, what's wrong?

516
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:11,280
Can you spare a minute

517
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:12,120
