518
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:13,480
Let's walk.

519
00:23:22,200 --> 00:23:23,360
Have you heard?

520
00:23:23,640 --> 00:23:25,000
After the training program ends,

521
00:23:25,520 --> 00:23:28,240
the group army is forming a New Quality Combined Force.

522
00:23:30,360 --> 00:23:32,600
I heard Deputy Army Commander Liang mention it.

523
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,720
Don't you have any thoughts about it?

524
00:23:38,840 --> 00:23:40,200
The training camp is probably meant to

525
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:42,400
select talent for the New Quality Combined Force.

526
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:44,440
Through this victory,

527
00:23:44,440 --> 00:23:45,600
your chances of getting selected are high.

528
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:48,080
I'm not talking about myself.

529
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:49,120
I'm talking about you.

530
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:51,560
Me?

531
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,800
I think the New Quality Combined Force

532
00:23:54,120 --> 00:23:55,760
really needs talent like you.

533
00:23:56,040 --> 00:23:57,400
If you go to Beijing,

534
00:23:57,800 --> 00:24:00,160
you'll just be a military researcher.

535
00:24:00,560 --> 00:24:01,720
But if you stay here,

536
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:02,680
I promise

537
00:24:03,120 --> 00:24:04,600
you can continue your research project.

538
00:24:05,120 --> 00:24:06,040
So,

539
00:24:06,600 --> 00:24:07,280
stay.

540
00:24:07,800 --> 00:24:08,840
You won't regret it.

541
00:24:09,280 --> 00:24:10,120
How can you promise that?

542
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:16,600
I...

543
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:20,440
Guo Zijian,

544
00:24:21,080 --> 00:24:22,080
let's make a deal.

545
00:24:22,560 --> 00:24:23,360
What deal?

546
00:24:23,880 --> 00:24:24,880
If you can become

547
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:26,760
the leader of the New Quality Combined Force,

548
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,840
then I'll consider staying.

549
00:24:30,760 --> 00:24:31,480
It's a deal.

550
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:33,680
It's a deal.

551
00:24:42,040 --> 00:24:42,640
Lao Suo.

552
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:46,080
Because the feasibility study of this new project

553
00:24:46,840 --> 00:24:47,480
is quite tedious,

554
00:24:48,600 --> 00:24:49,680
lately,

555
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:51,960
my time on duty has been intermittent.

556
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:53,760
Thanks for your hard work.

557
00:24:54,040 --> 00:24:54,800
Not at all.

558
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:56,520
It's all part of my job.

559
00:24:57,520 --> 00:24:58,280
Actually,

560
00:24:58,600 --> 00:24:59,720
during my mission this time,

561
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:01,240
I also had some selfish motives.

562
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:03,960
I specifically submitted a report to the leaders,

563
00:25:04,360 --> 00:25:06,120
to have you act as the brigade commander.

564
00:25:06,520 --> 00:25:08,440
Thank you for your high regard, Commander Yang.

565
00:25:09,400 --> 00:25:11,480
Actually, I still feel that I

566
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:12,920
lack the capability,

567
00:25:13,480 --> 00:25:14,520
and I've disappointed everyone.

568
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:16,880
No need to be so polite with me.

569
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:19,640
After coming back this time,

570
00:25:19,840 --> 00:25:21,440
I found that all the brigade's work

571
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:22,960
has greatly improved.

572
00:25:23,360 --> 00:25:25,600
Commissar Kang also speaks highly of your work.

573
00:25:26,280 --> 00:25:27,840
Actually, he's the one holding it all together.

574
00:25:31,000 --> 00:25:32,760
Originally, I wanted to give you

575
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:34,440
a few days off after I came back.

576
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:37,680
I didn't expect the group army to organize another

577
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:39,640
