578
00:25:39,760 --> 00:25:40,880
And you were drafted again

579
00:25:40,880 --> 00:25:42,080
to be the deputy captain of the training team.

580
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:43,720
What do they say?

581
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:45,520
A loud drum needs a heavy mallet.

582
00:25:45,520 --> 00:25:46,800
I have nothing more to add.

583
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:47,840
Just keep up the good work.

584
00:25:48,080 --> 00:25:50,080
Seeing that this training is ending soon,

585
00:25:50,360 --> 00:25:51,360
there is something

586
00:25:52,240 --> 00:25:53,560
I want to remind you of.

587
00:25:54,520 --> 00:25:55,280
What is it?

588
00:25:56,280 --> 00:25:57,160
Before long,

589
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:59,480
I will fully devote myself to

590
00:25:59,880 --> 00:26:01,320
the research of the new subject.

591
00:26:01,680 --> 00:26:03,080
I won't be able to manage both anymore.

592
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,400
I understand.

593
00:26:05,280 --> 00:26:08,600
Then I'll congratulate you in advance, Commander Yang.

594
00:26:09,640 --> 00:26:10,640
It's a lateral transfer.

595
00:26:10,800 --> 00:26:11,840
Just a change of job.

596
00:26:11,840 --> 00:26:12,760
Nothing to congratulate me for.

597
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:14,920
But after I leave,

598
00:26:15,120 --> 00:26:16,240
regarding the position of brigade commander,

599
00:26:16,600 --> 00:26:17,320
what are your thoughts?

600
00:26:20,120 --> 00:26:21,920
I will obey the organization's arrangements.

601
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:25,640
The higher-ups have also talked to me.

602
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:27,240
My opinion is very clear.

603
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,560
I won't say anything against our principles.

604
00:26:30,960 --> 00:26:32,880
I hope you'll work harder during this period,

605
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:33,720
and achieve more results.

606
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:36,240
I definitely won't disappoint

607
00:26:36,320 --> 00:26:37,760
the high expectations of the leaders.

608
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:40,680
There is one thing

609
00:26:41,560 --> 00:26:43,360
I know you've been worried about.

610
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:45,840
It's about the last drill

611
00:26:46,080 --> 00:26:46,960
where we suffered a defeat.

612
00:26:48,680 --> 00:26:49,920
I'm telling you clearly now,

613
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:52,840
this matter and your appointment

614
00:26:53,080 --> 00:26:54,200
have no direct connection.

615
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:55,680
Go all out and do it.

616
00:26:55,960 --> 00:26:56,440
Yes, sir.

617
00:26:58,040 --> 00:26:59,720
I'll give my all

618
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:01,080
to the organization.

619
00:27:04,680 --> 00:27:05,720
You're back.

620
00:27:08,280 --> 00:27:08,920
How is it?

621
00:27:08,920 --> 00:27:10,560
We've prepared a huge feast.

622
00:27:10,560 --> 00:27:11,520
Are you satisfied?

623
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:12,800
Brigade Commander Suo.

624
00:27:13,520 --> 00:27:14,520
A bit too early.

625
00:27:14,840 --> 00:27:16,080
The orders haven't come down yet.

626
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:17,880
Isn't it just a matter of time?

627
00:27:18,680 --> 00:27:19,960
With your seniority and ability,

628
00:27:20,040 --> 00:27:21,400
you should have been promoted long ago.

629
00:27:22,160 --> 00:27:22,760
Let me tell you,

630
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:25,880
we're speaking behind closed doors here.

631
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:26,960
Don't let others hear you.

632
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:28,760
It would reflect badly if the leaders found out.

633
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:30,400
I know, I know.

634
00:27:31,080 --> 00:27:32,400
I'm just happy for you.

635
00:27:34,320 --> 00:27:34,960
Anyway,

636
00:27:35,360 --> 00:27:37,360
until it's official,

637
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:39,560
don't speak too soon.

638
00:27:40,240 --> 00:27:42,040
You're just too tense.

639
00:27:46,960 --> 00:27:47,960
Brigade Commander Yang

640
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:50,920
formally spoke with me today.

641
00:27:51,280 --> 00:27:52,120
Really?

642
00:27:53,040 --> 00:27:54,400
So it's settled then?

643
00:27:57,320 --> 00:27:58,200
To be honest,

644
00:27:58,840 --> 00:27:59,960
if this were in the past,

645
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:02,680
I wouldn't care about being the brigade commander.

646
00:28:04,400 --> 00:28:05,640
It's different now.

647
00:28:06,040 --> 00:28:07,960
This new-type forces training team

648
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:10,400
is the testing ground for military reform.

649
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,200
Once I become the brigade commander,

650
00:28:12,320 --> 00:28:14,560
I'll have the authority to formulate plans.

651
00:28:15,760 --> 00:28:17,200
I want them all to see

652
00:28:17,560 --> 00:28:19,280
that this tree of mine, Suo Jian'an,

653
00:28:19,720 --> 00:28:21,840
can bear some truly good fruit.

654
00:28:23,800 --> 00:28:25,400
Anyway, as long as our Lao Suo is around,

655
00:28:25,840 --> 00:28:27,040
the fruit on this tree

656
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:29,240
will definitely grow big and round.

657
00:28:29,320 --> 00:28:30,600
Pretty much.

658
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:36,120
Lao Suo,

659
00:28:37,880 --> 00:28:40,200
the training team is about to graduate.

660
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:42,800
Regarding this graduation report,

661
00:28:43,080 --> 00:28:44,120
do you have any thoughts?

662
00:28:45,120 --> 00:28:46,040
The graduation report?

663
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:47,640
Jiang Shengqiang.

664
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:50,360
He is the champion of this competition,

665
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:52,840
so having him write the graduation report

666
00:28:53,200 --> 00:28:54,400
is entirely well-deserved.

667
00:28:55,320 --> 00:28:56,320
What about Guo Zijian?

668
00:28:58,240 --> 00:28:59,320
Guo Zijian...

669
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:06,040
Indeed.

670
00:29:06,040 --> 00:29:07,680
Guo Zijian defeated Wu Dazhou.

671
00:29:08,280 --> 00:29:09,040
But

672
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:11,160
I think it's mainly because his

673
00:29:11,160 --> 00:29:13,520
role as the Support Team captain confused the opponent.

674
00:29:13,680 --> 00:29:15,280
It was somewhat opportunistic.

675
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,560
Most importantly,

676
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:18,520
although he's in the training team,

677
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:20,240
he's responsible for the support work.

678
00:29:20,520 --> 00:29:22,360
He didn't participate in any training.

679
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:23,720
If we let him write it,

680
00:29:24,240 --> 00:29:25,280
I'm afraid there'll be criticism.

681
00:29:27,800 --> 00:29:28,520
But

682
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:30,960
Guo Zijian led the training team

683
00:29:30,960 --> 00:29:32,000
and defeated Wu Dazhou.

684
00:29:32,560 --> 00:29:33,680
This is an indisputable fact.

685
00:29:36,080 --> 00:29:38,360
I remember the recruitment notice stated

686
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:40,480
that all personnel of the training team

687
00:29:41,520 --> 00:29:43,880
could sign up regardless of their roles.

688
00:29:44,560 --> 00:29:46,160
So at a time like this,

689
00:29:46,320 --> 00:29:47,720
excluding him

690
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:49,600
isn't that a bit unreasonable?

691
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:53,920
It's not about excluding him.

692
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:55,240
You might not know this,

693
00:29:55,560 --> 00:29:58,240
but he withdrew his application halfway through.

694
00:29:58,600 --> 00:30:00,680
So he's no longer under consideration.

695
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:02,680
Lao Suo,

696
00:30:03,520 --> 00:30:06,120
the purpose of our recruitment notice

697
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:08,040
is to select talent.

698
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:10,600
Since right now,

699
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:12,480
both Jiang Shengqiang and Guo Zijian

700
00:30:12,480 --> 00:30:14,000
are rare talents,

701
00:30:16,440 --> 00:30:17,920
I think maybe we can do this.

702
00:30:18,920 --> 00:30:19,720
Let both of them

703
00:30:20,800 --> 00:30:23,400
each draft a graduation report proposal.

704
00:30:23,840 --> 00:30:24,920
We'll select the better one.

705
00:30:25,600 --> 00:30:26,520
What do you think?

706
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:29,040
You mean draft two proposals?

707
00:30:29,720 --> 00:30:30,560
One from each of them?

708
00:30:31,480 --> 00:30:32,520
I think it's a great idea.

709
00:30:33,320 --> 00:30:34,040
It's settled then.

710
00:30:38,760 --> 00:30:39,880
You win! You win!

711
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:42,120
You've got way too much stamina.

712
00:30:42,840 --> 00:30:45,720
We aren't that far apart in age,

713
00:30:45,720 --> 00:30:48,000
so why is the gap in our physical fitness so huge?

714
00:30:48,280 --> 00:30:49,040
I know, right?

715
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:51,040
I'm wondering that too.

716
00:30:52,320 --> 00:30:53,720
We're of the same age,

717
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:57,840
so why is the gap in our open-mindedness

718
00:30:59,040 --> 00:30:59,960
so huge?

719
00:31:00,840 --> 00:31:03,360
You really never have a good word to say.

720
00:31:05,880 --> 00:31:07,080
Alright, Liu Wangyuan.

721
00:31:07,480 --> 00:31:08,600
It's been a while since we played ball.

722
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:10,120
Tell me.

723
00:31:10,880 --> 00:31:11,800
What do you want from me?

724
00:31:12,720 --> 00:31:14,000
Got some new inside info?

725
00:31:14,640 --> 00:31:15,840
What inside info?

726
00:31:16,480 --> 00:31:17,320
Let me ask you.

727
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:20,440
The new-type core training team

728
00:31:20,840 --> 00:31:22,080
is about to graduate.

729
00:31:22,560 --> 00:31:24,920
You keep hiding in the Second Battalion instead of going back.

730
00:31:25,160 --> 00:31:26,080
What's the meaning of this?

731
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:28,480
Are you just going to hand over your hard-earned honor?

732
00:31:31,880 --> 00:31:33,440
A defeated general

733
00:31:34,080 --> 00:31:35,600
has no honor to speak of.

734
00:31:35,760 --> 00:31:37,400
This is why I say,

735
00:31:37,560 --> 00:31:39,880
you've really let Deputy Brigade Commander Suo down after all his mentoring.

736
00:31:43,400 --> 00:31:44,200
What are you trying to say?

737
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:47,680
About the graduation report,

738
00:31:48,280 --> 00:31:50,000
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo told you, right?

739
00:31:50,840 --> 00:31:51,560
He did.

740
00:31:53,320 --> 00:31:55,080
You can't just brush it off.

741
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:57,600
Whoever represents the training team

742
00:31:57,800 --> 00:31:58,960
to give this graduation report

743
00:31:59,200 --> 00:32:01,080
will directly affect the future.

744
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:04,080
It decides who becomes the core figure of the New Quality Combined Force.

745
00:32:04,480 --> 00:32:05,120
You know that?

746
00:32:06,920 --> 00:32:07,520
I know.

747
00:32:09,960 --> 00:32:11,240
Just knowing isn't enough.

748
00:32:14,800 --> 00:32:15,520
How about this?

749
00:32:16,080 --> 00:32:17,280
Later, I'll have someone

750
00:32:18,520 --> 00:32:19,760
from our Operations and Training Section

751
00:32:20,120 --> 00:32:22,680
send over some reference materials to you.

752
00:32:22,800 --> 00:32:25,080
You need to put in some serious effort these next few days.

753
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:26,280
No matter what,

754
00:32:26,400 --> 00:32:28,720
you must secure this spot, understand?

755
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:30,720
Don't take it lightly.

756
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:32,720
And definitely don't let it go to

757
00:32:32,760 --> 00:32:34,280
that kid Guo Zijian.

758
00:32:39,520 --> 00:32:40,280
Liu Wangyuan.

759
00:32:42,120 --> 00:32:43,360
Tell me the truth.

760
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:46,040
Do you feel that

761
00:32:46,560 --> 00:32:48,680
Guo Zijian leads the 1st Battalion better than you do?

762
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:50,440
Deep down,

763
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:53,200
are you a little bit jealous?

764
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:54,160
As if!

765
00:32:55,080 --> 00:32:56,080
Me, jealous of him?

766
00:32:56,960 --> 00:32:58,800
He just got blindly lucky

767
00:32:58,840 --> 00:32:59,640
and won once.

768
00:33:00,360 --> 00:33:02,360
Do you think that completely redeems him?

769
00:33:05,080 --> 00:33:06,000
Liu Wangyuan,

770
00:33:06,080 --> 00:33:07,120
it's really easy

771
00:33:07,960 --> 00:33:09,200
for you to say that.

772
00:33:10,440 --> 00:33:11,280
You try it. Come on.

773
00:33:11,520 --> 00:33:13,120
If you're so capable, let's see you

774
00:33:13,120 --> 00:33:14,840
get blindly lucky against someone like Wu Dazhou.

775
00:33:15,080 --> 00:33:16,040
Jiang Shengqiang,

776
00:33:16,520 --> 00:33:18,480
you're truly selfless.

777
00:33:21,880 --> 00:33:24,720
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo already made you the titleholder.

778
00:33:26,440 --> 00:33:27,920
Then Wu Dazhou came out of nowhere.

779
00:33:28,080 --> 00:33:29,160
And of all things,

780
00:33:29,160 --> 00:33:31,160
it ended up firing up Guo Zijian.

781
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:32,800
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo

782
00:33:32,960 --> 00:33:33,880
looks at the big picture.

783
00:33:34,320 --> 00:33:35,760
Whoever beats Wu Dazhou,

784
00:33:35,760 --> 00:33:37,000
he's happy about it.

785
00:33:38,120 --> 00:33:40,600
But think carefully, is it really that simple?

786
00:33:41,360 --> 00:33:42,200
No matter what anyone says,

787
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:44,520
Guo Zijian was parachuted in halfway through.

788
00:33:44,800 --> 00:33:45,600
Do you think

789
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:48,360
he can truly represent our 396th Brigade?

790
00:33:52,160 --> 00:33:52,800
So,

791
00:33:53,560 --> 00:33:55,520
if the new-type combat forces

792
00:33:55,760 --> 00:33:58,640
can truly form a combined unit,

793
00:33:58,760 --> 00:34:01,600
then the one leading them must be you, Jiang Shengqiang.

794
00:34:02,360 --> 00:34:03,760
Think about it carefully.

795
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:09,840
What a headache.

796
00:34:34,080 --> 00:34:34,600
Come in.

797
00:34:36,560 --> 00:34:39,320
Professor Zhang came to teach the training team today.

798
00:34:39,360 --> 00:34:41,320
He also observed their various training sessions.

799
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:43,880
I heard Deputy Army Commander Liang invited him.

800
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:46,640
He said he hopes to get support from experts

801
00:34:47,080 --> 00:34:48,760
to help expedite the establishment

802
00:34:48,880 --> 00:34:50,440
of the New Quality Combined Force.

803
00:34:51,200 --> 00:34:52,520
I think that's the idea.

804
00:34:56,560 --> 00:34:59,360
Professor Zhang was my graduate advisor.

805
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:01,640
So he shared with me privately

806
00:35:01,640 --> 00:35:03,000
his views on this matter.

807
00:35:03,240 --> 00:35:03,960
What did he say?

808
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:07,160
Personally, I feel

809
00:35:07,680 --> 00:35:09,520
he doesn't seem very optimistic about it.

810
00:35:10,840 --> 00:35:12,920
He said our planning for the training force,

811
00:35:13,160 --> 00:35:14,840
aside from the different equipment,

812
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:17,080
is basically the Special Forces battalion model

813
00:35:17,120 --> 00:35:18,320
with no qualitative difference.

814
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:20,600
Not to mention,

815
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:22,600
the development of air assault forces

816
00:35:22,600 --> 00:35:23,640
is already gradually maturing.

817
00:35:23,640 --> 00:35:24,680
So he thinks

818
00:35:25,920 --> 00:35:27,320
there's no need to overcomplicate things.

819
00:35:27,720 --> 00:35:29,160
What kind of logic is that?

820
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,280
No, I'm going to talk to him.

821
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:33,960
He's already left.

822
00:35:35,160 --> 00:35:37,480
This afternoon, the superiors will hold

823
00:35:37,520 --> 00:35:39,080
a feasibility meeting on this issue.

824
00:35:39,120 --> 00:35:40,360
He was invited to attend.

825
00:35:41,520 --> 00:35:42,960
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

826
00:35:43,120 --> 00:35:43,840
What if...

827
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:44,760
There is no "what if."

828
00:35:45,280 --> 00:35:46,360
Knowing him like I do,

829
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:48,240
he'll definitely voice his opposition.

830
00:35:53,320 --> 00:35:54,240
This Professor Zhang...

831
00:35:54,240 --> 00:35:56,680
We invited him to lecture at the training unit before.

832
00:35:57,680 --> 00:35:59,960
And he's not the only one with objections.

833
00:36:00,120 --> 00:36:01,360
He's just their representative.

834
00:36:01,720 --> 00:36:02,560
I know.

835
00:36:03,680 --> 00:36:04,880
Speaking of which,

836
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:06,240
it was quite a twist of fate.

837
00:36:06,720 --> 00:36:08,120
Originally, your exploration

838
00:36:08,520 --> 00:36:09,480
was just intended for our theater command,

839
00:36:09,480 --> 00:36:11,200
as a trial within the army.

840
00:36:12,280 --> 00:36:14,520
I was still hoping this little ball of dough

841
00:36:14,600 --> 00:36:17,000
would suddenly rise into a big loaf of bread for me one day.

842
00:36:17,640 --> 00:36:19,400
But with your challenge match causing such a stir,

843
00:36:19,760 --> 00:36:21,600
plus the Special Forces getting involved,

844
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:23,200
this fire wrapped in paper

845
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,520
could no longer stay hidden.

846
00:36:26,720 --> 00:36:28,080
Thinking about it now,

847
00:36:28,440 --> 00:36:29,480
this challenge match

848
00:36:29,800 --> 00:36:30,920
was a bit impulsive.

849
00:36:31,680 --> 00:36:32,680
However,

850
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:34,320
we are willing to accept

851
00:36:34,440 --> 00:36:35,480
the questioning from all the experts

852
00:36:35,520 --> 00:36:37,840
and higher authorities,

853
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:39,040
or even their rejection.

854
00:36:41,960 --> 00:36:42,600
In recent years,

855
00:36:43,400 --> 00:36:44,640
the army has had

856
00:36:44,840 --> 00:36:46,680
many ideas for reform and innovation.

857
00:36:46,880 --> 00:36:48,080
But looking across the world,

858
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,920
they all seem to have hit a bottleneck,

859
00:36:50,400 --> 00:36:52,040
limited by geographical environments

860
00:36:52,240 --> 00:36:53,400
and troop combinations,

861
00:36:53,760 --> 00:36:55,080
and also limited by

862
00:36:55,200 --> 00:36:56,720
the influence of inherent combat modes.

863
00:36:57,520 --> 00:36:58,160
Therefore,

864
00:36:58,680 --> 00:36:59,720
armies of all countries

865
00:36:59,760 --> 00:37:01,160
are eager for a breakthrough,

866
00:37:01,400 --> 00:37:03,640
an effective breakthrough at that.

867
00:37:05,480 --> 00:37:06,680
Our exploration

868
00:37:07,000 --> 00:37:08,600
can't avoid these hurdles.

869
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:09,840
Actually,

870
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:11,240
the higher authorities

871
00:37:11,520 --> 00:37:12,400
saw exactly

872
00:37:12,400 --> 00:37:14,520
the changes and opportunities brought by this exploration,

873
00:37:14,640 --> 00:37:15,680
which is why they pay more attention to it.

874
00:37:16,040 --> 00:37:17,040
In the long run,

875
00:37:17,640 --> 00:37:18,560
it's a good thing.

876
00:37:18,640 --> 00:37:19,560
Comrade Chief,

877
00:37:19,960 --> 00:37:21,920
let's leave the long-term things to time.

878
00:37:22,040 --> 00:37:23,640
I'm just asking what to do right now.

879
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:25,120
We can't just give up halfway, right?

880
00:37:27,320 --> 00:37:27,920
Beihua,

881
00:37:29,160 --> 00:37:30,560
you've been serving as Deputy Army Commander

882
00:37:30,920 --> 00:37:32,000
for four years now, right?

883
00:37:32,280 --> 00:37:33,360
More than four years.

884
00:37:33,400 --> 00:37:35,040
I've already finished my fourth year.

885
00:37:36,080 --> 00:37:37,520
Look at this momentum,

886
00:37:37,880 --> 00:37:39,360
your drive is still as strong as ever.

887
00:37:39,800 --> 00:37:40,520
You know me.

888
00:37:40,880 --> 00:37:42,480
I can't do things the slow and steady way.

889
00:37:44,400 --> 00:37:45,600
I called you here,

890
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:47,520
firstly, to discuss

891
00:37:47,680 --> 00:37:48,840
the progress of this matter.

892
00:37:49,360 --> 00:37:51,200
Secondly, to ask for your opinion.

893
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:53,080
If you have concerns,

894
00:37:53,120 --> 00:37:54,080
then I'll just

895
00:37:54,200 --> 00:37:56,480
get a younger cadre to take charge.

896
00:37:57,680 --> 00:37:59,040
What do you mean, Chief?

897
00:38:00,200 --> 00:38:01,480
Are you saying

898
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:03,680
I should just sit in an office starting today,

899
00:38:03,680 --> 00:38:05,680
attend meetings, make reports,

900
00:38:05,880 --> 00:38:07,720
and quietly wait for a promotion from above?

901
00:38:09,280 --> 00:38:11,360
How did my words get twisted like that in your mouth?

902
00:38:11,720 --> 00:38:13,080
I appreciate your care.

903
00:38:14,320 --> 00:38:14,960
Fine,

904
00:38:15,720 --> 00:38:18,080
then I'll just cut to the chase.

905
00:38:19,520 --> 00:38:21,160
As for building the new-type forces,

906
00:38:21,640 --> 00:38:22,440
we will do it,

907
00:38:22,800 --> 00:38:23,400
and what's more,

908
00:38:23,760 --> 00:38:24,600
we'll see it through to the end.

909
00:38:25,120 --> 00:38:26,640
That's exactly what I was waiting to hear.

910
00:38:26,760 --> 00:38:27,800
Don't cheer just yet.

911
00:38:28,040 --> 00:38:30,080
That fireball in the stove in front of you,

912
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:31,760
whether it's steel or iron,

913
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:32,960
and what its quality is,

914
00:38:33,320 --> 00:38:34,640
I have to see for myself.

915
00:38:35,360 --> 00:38:36,720
I can't just easily give it a pass.

916
00:38:37,600 --> 00:38:38,240
Fine.

917
00:38:38,840 --> 00:38:40,480
Tell me in advance which day you're going.

918
00:38:40,520 --> 00:38:41,760
So I can prepare for you.

919
00:38:41,960 --> 00:38:43,040
No need to prepare.

920
00:38:43,360 --> 00:38:44,720
And you are not allowed to prepare.

921
00:38:46,880 --> 00:38:48,360
You, a high-ranking leader,

922
00:38:48,520 --> 00:38:49,720
are actually doing surprise inspections?

923
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:52,280
Cut the crap. Old rules.

924
00:38:56,560 --> 00:38:58,480
You've read both of their plans.

925
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:00,640
Which one do you think is more suitable?

926
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:11,560
I'd say

927
00:39:12,680 --> 00:39:13,760
they both have their merits.

928
00:39:16,200 --> 00:39:17,600
It really is a tough choice.

929
00:39:20,320 --> 00:39:20,880
Currently,

930
00:39:20,880 --> 00:39:23,120
our idea to establish the New Quality Combined Force

931
00:39:24,240 --> 00:39:26,120
is facing some differing opinions.

932
00:39:27,360 --> 00:39:28,560
The army group's intention

933
00:39:28,560 --> 00:39:29,880
is to use this presentation

934
00:39:30,360 --> 00:39:31,880
to change the views of some comrades.

935
00:39:32,760 --> 00:39:34,480
So this final training report

936
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:36,480
is extremely crucial.

937
00:39:37,320 --> 00:39:39,720
We aim to use this brand-new model

938
00:39:40,400 --> 00:39:42,440
to make the combined structure of new-type combat forces

939
00:39:42,440 --> 00:39:43,360
much clearer.

940
00:39:43,840 --> 00:39:45,280
In this regard,

941
00:39:45,600 --> 00:39:46,640
I believe

942
00:39:47,640 --> 00:39:49,120
Guo Zijian's plan

943
00:39:49,880 --> 00:39:50,800
is superior.

944
00:39:54,960 --> 00:39:55,480
Lao Suo,

945
00:39:56,240 --> 00:39:57,440
I know you have concerns,

946
00:39:58,360 --> 00:39:59,320
but this time,

947
00:40:00,200 --> 00:40:01,320
we must focus on the big picture.

948
00:40:05,240 --> 00:40:06,080
I agree.

949
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:07,840
Then this time,

950
00:40:08,800 --> 00:40:10,040
let's have Guo Zijian

951
00:40:10,600 --> 00:40:13,320
take charge of our final training report.

952
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:27,560
The special reconnaissance unit's operation has begun.

953
00:40:33,440 --> 00:40:35,000
For your viewing convenience,

954
00:40:35,360 --> 00:40:37,480
we have switched the view to

955
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:39,240
the micro-cameras on the soldiers' helmets

956
00:40:39,280 --> 00:40:40,360
and the accompanying footage.

957
00:41:03,880 --> 00:41:04,440
Lao Liang.

958
00:41:05,600 --> 00:41:07,440
This isn't the designated exercise area.

959
00:41:07,640 --> 00:41:09,480
This is our group army's special ammunition depot.

960
00:41:09,680 --> 00:41:10,320
Yeah.

961
00:41:10,840 --> 00:41:12,000
I just noticed that too.

962
00:41:13,200 --> 00:41:14,080
To avoid interfering with

963
00:41:14,080 --> 00:41:15,800
Guo Zijian and his team's creative ideas,

964
00:41:15,880 --> 00:41:17,440
I didn't make them report in advance

965
00:41:17,560 --> 00:41:18,880
the subjects of this exercise.

966
00:41:19,160 --> 00:41:20,400
I didn't expect their first shot

967
00:41:20,560 --> 00:41:21,920
to hit the group army's

968
00:41:22,160 --> 00:41:24,680
most heavily guarded special ammo depot.

969
00:41:29,240 --> 00:41:30,000
Team Two, be advised.

970
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:32,760
Two roving sentries inside the ammo depot.

971
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:34,680
Their patrol route

972
00:41:34,680 --> 00:41:37,720
goes from the east second-floor stairs to the west ground level.

973
00:41:38,640 --> 00:41:39,880
A single patrol takes

974
00:41:40,200 --> 00:41:41,440
about five minutes,

975
00:41:41,600 --> 00:41:42,840
with a two-minute interval.

976
00:42:21,120 --> 00:42:22,000
Recon detachment

977
00:42:22,000 --> 00:42:24,000
has completed its reconnaissance on

978
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:25,160
Ammunition Depot No. 29.

979
00:42:25,440 --> 00:42:28,120
All facilities and passages inside and outside the depot,

980
00:42:28,240 --> 00:42:29,840
along with the ammunition storage status,

981
00:42:29,920 --> 00:42:32,160
have all been captured in data and images.

982
00:42:32,920 --> 00:42:35,120
Mission well done. Prepare to return to base.

983
00:42:35,640 --> 00:42:36,040
Yes, sir.

984
00:42:42,480 --> 00:42:43,240
Commanders,

985
00:42:43,960 --> 00:42:46,280
please adhere to the observation rules.

986
00:42:46,800 --> 00:42:48,480
We have just intercepted

987
00:42:48,640 --> 00:42:50,480
an attempt to use a text message

988
00:42:50,680 --> 00:42:51,840
to tip off the ammunition depot.
